# BhumiLipi-v1

AI-powered land fraud detection and verification platform for Bangladesh.

## Overview
BhumiLipi aims to make land ownership more transparent, secure, and trustworthy by helping users verify land information and identify potential fraud risks.

## Key Features
- Digital Land Identity (Land Passport)
- Land Ownership Verification
- Land Fraud Risk Detection
- Ownership and Transfer History
- QR-based Land Verification

